Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.07,0:00:02.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.53,0:00:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.49,0:00:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire culture of moe is gone from Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin, wait up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.49,0:00:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.87,0:00:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.58,0:00:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the Toranoana? The Animate?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.41,0:00:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,The Mandarake? The Gamers?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.37,0:00:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would those be in Akiba?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.67,0:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm going to Nakano to get my comics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.09,0:00:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayuri,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,you work part-time at MayQueen, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.13,0:00:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,MayQueen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.18,0:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,MayQueen NyanNyan!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.35,0:00:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.35,0:00:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Faris was the one who requested to bring the culture of moe to Akiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.98,0:00:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She sent a D-Mail preventing that from ever happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.11,0:00:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}With just one message,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.66,0:00:53.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}the whole town changed.
