Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.43,0:02:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that MayQueen used to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,MayQueen? Is that a potato?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.77,0:02:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,During summer, I prefer noodles to potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.44,0:02:50.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't a potato...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.90,0:02:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,If MayQueen never existed, then how did we meet Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.61,0:03:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it's thanks to potato ramen that we met her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.58,0:03:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.21,0:03:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,On the day of the Rai-Net Tournament in Ikebukuro,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I got sick from the potato ramen I had for lunch,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.29,0:03:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,so I withdrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.71,0:03:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And then?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii and you entered as a pair,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.88,0:03:18.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and you went up against Faris.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.76,0:03:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You totally lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.97,0:03:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,but Mayushii and Faris became friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.85,0:03:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look, Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.27,0:03:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought this cosplayer's photobook yesterday in Nakano!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:34.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}So cute...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.57,0:03:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The past changed, but our relationships haven't?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.62,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You seem to have lots of time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.12,0:03:44.29,Default,,0,0,0,,on your hands with this Bon Festival, lab mem girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.79,0:03:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Cute, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! It's Sedona from {\i1}Blood Tune{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.96,0:03:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really detailed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.67,0:03:53.92,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a swimsuit version too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.92,0:03:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I wish I could be like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.63,0:03:57.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have those proportions.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.97,0:03:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Flat is justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.05,0:04:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.18,0:04:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not take all the lab mems and go to the beach?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.18,0:04:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,With Kurisu too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:09.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, wear your school swimsuits, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.65,0:04:12.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going swimming with a pervert.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:17.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well... I mean, if it's just the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.95,0:04:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd love to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.20,0:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not be honest, Christina?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.37,0:04:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.49,0:04:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,anyone to see the mole on your rear,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.95,0:04:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so you can't go. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.50,0:04:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no mole!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.63,0:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And if it's just the girls,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,then Lukako can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.92,0:04:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you earlier, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.38,0:04:42.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That Lukako's actually a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.61,0:04:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real jerk, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.28,0:04:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How can you call a girl a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.40,0:05:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii doesn't like it when you say stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.78,0:05:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that really mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.37,0:05:07.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.79,0:05:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.70,0:05:11.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologize to Urushibara. Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:12.42,Default,,0,0,0,,No, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.42,0:05:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would I apologize? It's true—
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.17,0:05:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.09,0:05:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what you think of me, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.80,0:05:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no, no, Lukako! You're really...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,How long will you keep that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.59,0:05:24.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going home!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.97,0:05:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.26,0:05:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a guy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.06,0:05:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look! Right here, you have...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.48,0:05:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone! There's nothing here!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.57,0:05:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, stop it...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.74,0:05:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Lukako, you're a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.08,0:05:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been saying that this whole time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.33,0:05:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo! Uh, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.38,0:05:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.71,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a bit of torture...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.38,0:05:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Torture?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.71,0:06:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,By Makise Kurisu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.38,0:06:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I've rectified the misunderstanding...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.14,0:06:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She got your legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch my legs!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.02,0:06:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,She made me sit on my knees for an hour!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.06,0:06:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I mean, I was tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.73,0:06:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh... That isn't torture.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.40,0:06:26.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You almost sound like you've been tortured.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I {\i1}am{\i0} a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.75,0:06:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a perfect day for biking...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.54,0:06:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.30,0:06:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go for a ride?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.94,0:06:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this what you call biking?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.98,0:07:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I came to Tokyo to find my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.66,0:07:07.16,Default,,0,0,0,,To find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.16,0:07:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he disappear or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.29,0:07:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even remember his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.45,0:07:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But I know he's in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.46,0:07:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my only clue...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.29,0:07:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,a badge he used to own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you shouldn't waste time at a part-time job, should you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.88,0:07:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,There's some stuff going on, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.05,0:07:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's one chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.68,0:07:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My dad might show up tomorrow at a certain place.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.23,0:07:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If I miss that chance, I'll have to leave this town.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's somewhere I have to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.20,0:07:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a busy person, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.16,0:07:53.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I always planned to give up if I couldn't meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.08,0:07:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're worried, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.75,0:07:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I can understand that feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's too bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.55,0:08:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Your luck ran out the minute
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.42,0:08:08.59,Default,,0,0,0,,you spoke to the great mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.51,0:08:12.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You are now Lab Mem 008!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.47,0:08:15.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You will be our guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.93,0:08:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Wh-What are you going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.81,0:08:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Change the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.27,0:08:21.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You may think me cruel if you like,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.31,0:08:25.03,Default,,0,0,0,,but there's no escape for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.03,0:08:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Send a D-Mail to your father before he leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.61,0:08:32.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell him not to leave his daughter behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.66,0:08:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a good person, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.54,0:08:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.25,0:08:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Somehow, I feel a bit better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.38,0:08:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks for talking to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.18,0:08:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.26,0:08:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you see him tomorrow or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.47,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,come by the lab!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.81,0:08:56.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I will use your sentimentality
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.64,0:08:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,for an experiment with the D-Mail!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You really are a mad scientist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.61,0:09:04.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's terrible...{Nanoha laughing oh god my nutbladder}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.91,0:09:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will now explain
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.70,0:09:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,the parameters of Operation Eldhrímnir.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.87,0:09:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,More Norse myths?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,If the part-time warrior meets her father,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.00,0:09:25.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll hold a celebration,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.67,0:09:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,a last supper in Tokyo, for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.42,0:09:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And if she doesn't,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.26,0:09:31.72,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll try to cheer her up,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,and then send a D-Mail.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Daru?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.39,0:09:39.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's meeting his online friends tonight,\Nso he said he can't join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:41.39,Default,,0,0,0,,The fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've taken steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:48.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\b1\blur2.25\frx6\fry0\pos(903,69)\frz2.693}To: Daru
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:48.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\frz3.745\blur2.25\b1\pos(738,280.5)}Now is the time to choose
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.19,0:09:48.65,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\a4\pos(351,835.5)\frz3.992\blur2.25\b1\fs90}Faris's cooking or your meeting. \NWhich will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.81,0:09:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I sent this message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris's cooking or your meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.69,0:09:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Which will you choose?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.49,0:09:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But Faris can't come, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.12,0:09:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris has never met the part-time warrior,\Nso it's pointless for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.16,0:10:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but Daru has a duty to participate in this operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.62,0:10:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... I've never met this Suzuha person either.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.17,0:10:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.34,0:10:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sending you all shopping for the banquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.47,0:10:12.09,Default,,0,0,0,,And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.59,0:10:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I will follow the part-time warrior
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.43,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and report in on the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.51,0:10:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.89,0:10:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Let the father and daughter have their time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.39,0:10:21.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Come shopping with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.89,0:10:24.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm following—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.65,0:10:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.61,0:10:29.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me what to do, assistant...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.32,0:10:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to sit on your knees again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,This time for three hours...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then! Let's get things ready for the party!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.08,0:10:43.25,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs117\blur4.5\frz11.275\move(465,1182,513,1029,0,170)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.25,0:10:43.46,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs117\blur4.5\frz11.275\move(513,1029,534,801,0,210)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.46,0:10:44.33,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\fs118.5\blur4.5\frz11.275\pos(534,801)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.33,0:10:44.83,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H20&\q2\b1\bord0\fs337.5\blur7.5\frz348.195\c&HC4C4C6&\pos(465,684)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.83,0:10:45.33,Sign1,,0,0,0,,{\alpha&H20&\q2\b1\bord0\fs322.5\blur7.5\frz336.369\c&HB1B1B4&\pos(-567,21)}I'm watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.42,0:10:52.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.63,0:10:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.22,0:11:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This is...?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.78,0:11:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think sweet curry will be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.53,0:11:15.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe spicy?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.91,0:11:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.70,0:11:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Uh... Spicy, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.62,0:11:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah! Suzu's a part-time warrior, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.87,0:11:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If she's a warrior, she'll want spicy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.25,0:11:31.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Next is the meat, the meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Beef sure is expensive...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.97,0:11:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.22,0:11:43.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Back there, you would've normally said...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.60,0:11:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,"The Organization's interference has increased the price of beef!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.15,0:11:52.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Has Operation Time Sale begun?" or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.90,0:11:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need to use Norse mythology there, not "Time Sale."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.16,0:12:01.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,The Organization's interference has caused unexpected expenses
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.33,0:12:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,in Operation Audhumbla.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.37,0:12:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm requesting additional funds for the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.79,0:12:11.59,Default,,0,0,0,,The first star!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Venus?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.59,0:12:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.22,0:12:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember in elementary school
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:26.14,Default,,0,0,0,,when you got really sick with a high fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.77,0:12:31.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, and the world was panicking over Y2K.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:38.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Mayushii was really scared you would die then.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.70,0:12:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I prayed to the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.45,0:12:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, there was a shooting star.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.62,0:12:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I said to the shooting star,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.67,0:12:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,"Don't die, Okarin!" three times.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And the next day, you got better!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.68,0:13:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And so, I saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.47,0:13:05.81,Default,,0,0,0,,No, that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.81,0:13:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It was the choice of Steins Gate
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.64,0:13:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,that I survived back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:14.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It was.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:15.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.57,0:13:19.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, remember what you said
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.28,0:13:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,when you got sick and collapsed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.70,0:13:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,"Everything I saw began to flow together,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.12,0:13:30.71,Default,,0,0,0,,and suddenly, I began to shake and couldn't stand up."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.25,0:13:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You looked just like that
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:35.92,Default,,0,0,0,,in Faris's condominium.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.46,0:13:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The feeling I had when I got that fever
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.59,0:13:44.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}was just like the feeling I get when I move worldlines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.80,0:13:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Which means...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.26,0:13:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I attained my magic eye, Reading Steiner,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.22,0:13:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}at that moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.81,0:13:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.44,0:13:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.07,0:14:01.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you smell something weird?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's the smell of Kurisu's apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.87,0:14:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.91,0:14:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Want Mayushii to help too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.87,0:14:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you boil an egg?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.79,0:14:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.08,0:14:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Um... Can I use the PhoneWave?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.96,0:14:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you microwave a raw egg, it'll explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.13,0:14:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make the egg.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.84,0:14:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you chop up the mushrooms, Mayuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.93,0:14:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.30,0:14:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.35,0:14:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need mushrooms or boiled eggs for apple pie!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.89,0:14:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the salad to go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think a boiled egg and mushroom salad really go with apple pie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.15,0:14:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,And you,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.07,0:14:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,stop chopping up mushrooms over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.65,0:14:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.40,0:14:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.74,0:14:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems I've released the seals that bound a dark god.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.74,0:14:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,If I don't contact you within the hour,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.41,0:14:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,tell my parents I loved them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.00,0:14:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okabe, do you have a rice cooker?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.79,0:15:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:02.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Faris?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.51,0:15:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hashida, you've been deceived.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.18,0:15:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Faris said she couldn't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.30,0:15:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.93,0:15:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Okarin!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.18,0:15:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time I get a chance, I'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.56,0:15:14.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw you!{Fuck you!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.48,0:15:16.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was really looking forward to my time machine forum meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machine forum?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's with a sci-fi message board I frequent a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A professional author was supposed to go too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.24,0:15:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an interestingly shaped mess kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.28,0:15:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.20,0:15:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not a mess kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.66,0:15:32.79,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Future Gadget #4, Moad Snake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.79,0:15:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,A claymore?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.79,0:15:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's made to look like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.66,0:15:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a super-instant humidifier.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.96,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:39.71,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stop! Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.64,0:15:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Okabe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.89,0:15:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.93,0:15:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, don't touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.98,0:15:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, couldn't we use this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.65,0:16:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,A vacuum cleaner?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.82,0:16:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.15,0:16:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Future Gadget #3.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.86,0:16:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Or #2?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.15,0:16:08.61,Default,,0,0,0,,#5!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.61,0:16:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And its name is
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.66,0:16:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,"Once Again I Have Created Something Worthless"
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,by Goemon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.41,0:16:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it so you can use a vacuum cleaner's output to warm a dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.87,0:16:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.58,0:16:20.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.63,0:16:22.21,Default,,0,0,0,,When you use that, you need to turn off
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.21,0:16:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,any other appliances, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...it'll trigger the breaker.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.93,0:16:30.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's the flashlight?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.80,0:16:33.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Miss Luka.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.01,0:16:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a radish.{daikon=large root, but also called white radish. also well-known by its nip name, but just being safe}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Um, where's the breaker?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.31,0:16:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you walk around...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.56,0:16:42.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.15,0:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.65,0:16:46.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The breaker's in the front hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.07,0:16:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.58,0:16:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What's so funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.66,0:16:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.04,0:16:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.83,0:17:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,the lab I worked at in America had some of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.29,0:17:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the best people from around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.01,0:17:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,But they all had really huge egos,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.01,0:17:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so it was also a really hostile place.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.97,0:17:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Compared to them, your lab is really childish,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,but it's a fun place to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.94,0:17:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm not praising you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just kinda thinking that...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.90,0:17:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess maybe I simply wanted friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.20,0:17:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.04,0:17:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I think of you as a companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.16,0:17:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You told me before, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.00,0:17:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That I was your dear companion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.21,0:17:49.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That made me really happy, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.60,0:17:56.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.68,0:17:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.06,0:18:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What? I'm trying to rethink my opinion of you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.02,0:18:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid Okabe!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.74,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Suzu's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.08,0:18:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if she met her dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.33,0:18:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I bet they're finally spending time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.71,0:18:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I told her to come to the lab either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,But it's late.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.92,0:18:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We're aborting the operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.47,0:18:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys, go on home.
