Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:19:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Does she plan to leave the city by herself?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.99,0:19:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Hououin Kyouma, will not allow that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.75,0:19:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:11.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.47,0:19:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.55,0:19:17.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I send a D-Mail telling myself to follow her
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.39,0:19:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}no matter what this afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.06,0:19:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.31,0:19:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is it okay for me to use D-Mail
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}to change the past any more?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.94,0:19:30.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You're a good person, you know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.98,0:19:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somehow, I feel a bit better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.16,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I am the great mad scientist, Hououin Kyouma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What do I have to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.93,0:20:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Do not give in to your assistant's threats.
