Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.83,0:20:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Part-Time Warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.58,0:20:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Slacking off?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.42,0:20:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, we were all up really late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.76,0:20:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,we had a last supper for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.26,0:20:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,so you could be our guinea pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.72,0:20:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.39,0:20:47.89,Default,,0,0,0,,But the experiment never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know my dad's phone number.{phone's address, but come on}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.23,0:20:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to confirm something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.73,0:20:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,How did I catch you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.90,0:21:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.32,0:21:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You're underage. You shouldn't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.95,0:21:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just answer me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.33,0:21:10.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I was heading back from the time machine forum meeting...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Time machine forum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where your dad was supposed to show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, my dad's calling himself Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.76,0:21:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,John Titor?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.47,0:21:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not John... Barrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.51,0:21:24.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Barrel Titor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you that yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you take a video of it on your phone?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night was so fun...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.82,0:21:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It would've been more fun without Makise Kurisu, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.49,0:21:41.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Her apple pie was absolutely horrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.99,0:21:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,But Urushibara Luka's curry was great!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.49,0:21:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Your lab's kinda nice, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.37,0:21:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone's friends, and you always seem to have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.96,0:21:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt like I fit in so much anywhere else in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.88,0:21:58.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you're welcome anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.63,0:22:00.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Come whenever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.67,0:22:03.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lab mem now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.51,0:22:03.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.55,0:22:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll try to search for my father a little more!
